---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Cookies & Tracking | CQLocalPal" description="No advertising trackers, no third-party analytics on this site — the only data we hold is what you send us by WhatsApp or email.">
  <section>
    <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Cookies &amp; Tracking</h1>
      <p class="muted small">Last updated: 4 November 2026 · v1.0</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <h2>The short version</h2>
        <p>This website currently sets <strong>no tracking cookies</strong> and loads <strong>no third-party analytics or advertising scripts</strong>. The booking form has no server behind it — it opens WhatsApp on your own device.</p>
        <h2>What your browser may store anyway</h2>
        <p>If you use the <a href="/en/travel-kit/">offline travel kit</a>, your browser stores the saved guides in local cache storage on your device, under your control — removable any time from the kit page. That's the only local storage this site uses.</p>
        <h2>If we add analytics later</h2>
        <p>We plan privacy-friendly, cookieless visit statistics with a clear accept/decline choice. It will never load before you decide, declining will never break booking or reading, and this page gets updated first. Silence will not count as consent.</p>
        <h2>External services</h2>
        <p>WhatsApp (Meta) and your email provider process messages under their own policies once you leave this site. We don't embed maps, videos, or social widgets that follow you around.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
